	(text "48x WS2812C-2020-V6 (5 mA/ch) on VLED = TPS22917 load-switch output (main_power sheet, 2x 22 uF bulk there).\nData: nRF P0.06 (I2S SDOUT) = LED_DIN_MCU -> R40 220R -> LED_DIN -> D101 -> LED_D1 -> D102 -> ... -> D148 -> LED_D48 (TP40).\nD101 = pixel 0 at the mechanical index; pixels run in chain order around the ring. 3.3 V logic; DNP SN74LV1T34 option (U43/R43) if the margin is short.\nWS2812B-2020-V6 (C52917434, 12 mA/ch) is a footprint/pinout drop-in; firmware must then cap peak current."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "55e14554-050d-5dee-80aa-9dd8f61dce15")
	)
	(text "LED data input"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 36.83 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "96eb3588-9575-50b3-81e1-6677aa7a3c29")
	)
	(text "220R series (bounds DIN clamp current if P0.06 is high while VLED is off): place within 3 mm of the nRF pin (P0.06).\n100k pull-down at D101.DIN holds DIN low while P0.06 is\nhigh-Z (reset/DFU). FIRMWARE: send an all-zero frame and\ndrive P0.06 low (pinctrl sleep) before deasserting\nLED_PWR_EN. Never drive LED_DIN_MCU high while VLED is off:\nQOD holds VLED at 0 V and VI max = VDD + 0.7 V, so DIN\nwould back-power the ring through its ESD diode."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "350ac062-4266-54c4-837f-96f61c13559e")
	)
	(rectangle
		(start 12.7 34.29)
		(end 133.35 71.12)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1)
			(type dash)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(uuid "5b7ec56f-12d9-50ec-af10-864ea6bc3e58")
	)
	(text "Optional VLED-referenced level shifter (DNP)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 140.97 36.83 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9529a951-1f22-5832-9ec6-1d4571b4aac0")
	)
	(text "Default: R43 0R fitted, U43 not fitted (3.3 V drive; margin 0.1-0.2 V at VSYS 4.5 V on USB).\nIf the bench test at VSYS = 4.6 V shows bit errors: remove R43, fit U43 (powered from VLED,\nso it is unpowered whenever the ring is off) and C43."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 140.97 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9762693b-a159-5f4d-ac64-316ce2dbc226")
	)
